     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.39in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>为贯彻落实市教育局《绍兴市中小学开学前后疫情防控工作方案》文件要求，做好复学后校园疫情防控工作，按照教职员工</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>先培</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>训</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>后上</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>岗</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>原</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; LETTER-SPACING: 0px; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>则，</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>我校于4月</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px">7</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>日上午举行返校教职员工疫情防控培训会。此次会议主要包括校园内疫情防控专业知识培训和学校疫情防控相关政策、制度的解读与学习。会议由学校安全处组织，校党委副书记孙洪亮、副校长俞奇弘出席会议并讲话，全体高三教师和总务处、医务室、图书馆、实验室等处室部门成员，以及住管处生活指导老师参加会议。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 24px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 5.768in; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline; MAX-WIDTH: 800px; HEIGHT: 3.85in; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" alt=efaede215ce84bbb8890251de4f96f17.Jpeg src="http://www.sxyz.net/Upload/sxyz/ContentManage/Article/image/2020/04/09/efaede215ce84bbb8890251de4f96f17.Jpeg"></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.39in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>首先，校医务室范国娟医师就开学后如何开展学生的晨、午、晚检工作向各参会人员进行了说明，同时还就检测表格的填写做了明确的规定，并就额温枪的使用方法以及注意事项、清洁消毒一般方法等进行了详细培训。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 24px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 5.768in; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline; MAX-WIDTH: 800px; HEIGHT: 3.85in; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" alt=6adfaf24fccc4f279fb8f1f13c97ae33.Jpeg src="http://www.sxyz.net/Upload/sxyz/ContentManage/Article/image/2020/04/09/6adfaf24fccc4f279fb8f1f13c97ae33.Jpeg"></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.39in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>随后，安全处主任陈锋着眼“外防输入、内防扩散”的防控总要求，以“绍兴市第一中学师生在校一日流程图”为主线，结合“绍兴市第一中学开学学生受控进校流程图”和“绍兴市第一中学开学教职员工受控进校流程图”，对我校制定的“三案六组九制度”为教工们做了详细解读，使教职员工对上级及学校的规定与要求有了全面的认识，也熟悉掌握突发情况下进行应急处置的措施。</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 24px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.33in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px"><IMG style="BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; WIDTH: 5.768in; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline; MAX-WIDTH: 800px; HEIGHT: 3.85in; VERTICAL-ALIGN: top; BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px" alt=8dce82735b344c269b53a2e8f725e9ff.Jpeg src="http://www.sxyz.net/Upload/sxyz/ContentManage/Article/image/2020/04/09/8dce82735b344c269b53a2e8f725e9ff.Jpeg"></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 28px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0.29in; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,255); LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial" dir=ltr><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>副校长俞奇弘向大家解</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>读了《</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>绍兴市中小学开学前后疫情防控工作方案》</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>文件</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>。要</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>求</SPAN><SPAN style="PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; FONT-STYLE: normal; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; PADDING-TOP: 0px" lang=zh-CN>坚决防范校外感染输入校园和校内交叉感染两种情况，确保疫情防控和返校开学“两手硬、两战赢”，严格实施校内网格管理，坚决做到“八个暂停”，精准实施应急处置。另外还介绍了学校在疫情防控期间所做大量的准备工作，对师生每日健康监测、各项应急工作流程提出了具体要求。</SPAN></P>
